                  <nc xml:id="m-5211391f-5619-4974-9ff0-822d79c2e527" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-cbf01175-74b3-459f-8263-5e3f747b8f35" facs="#m-ffeb36c9-ed37-4e04-bd6c-c136e575fdd8" pname="a" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-f36f716a-45c4-4ee2-9c56-54ddcd3d0118"><lg xml:id="m-768bc221-abe1-41dd-bed6-b8e525e7ab12"><l xml:id="m-0dee58cb-d246-4b34-9aaf-59dd08cb72e2" facs="#m-116a1073-df56-4e98-8185-a7b191792577" label="ambiguous">1800"</l><l xml:id="m-9dd698a8-dced-4f6c-adb9-6ec6f9a48fd2" facs="#m-952b0213-d4b2-4e36-bf5f-1b4a4c458e86" label="ambiguous">August 15.</l><l xml:id="m-6d8a5c79-1e88-449e-b1cd-c39ba7376010" facs="#m-0b1aafa1-a051-4287-84b4-639b9d790543" label="lyrics-like">Trí-adi perénnis, Quae tibi, Virgo, tribu-it cœrónam,</l><l xml:id="m-c765e828-930b-45ea-947c-01a3173c4393" facs="#m-b9a47c5f-8e7c-44e5-a199-abf5cbd46e4e" label="lyrics-like">Atque Regí-nam statu-itque nóstram Pró-vida mátrem.</l><l xml:id="m-a0576387-ca97-4dc9-8897-db3363090596" facs="#m-7067cfd2-46d5-4e13-b5d2-d9ff50b988a2" label="ambiguous">Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-32f41191-01f4-4a76-907b-58ee73b685db" facs="#m-eecaf963-3d0e-4630-8c43-c5bd76e19517" label="lyrics-like">v. Exaltáta est sáncta Déi Génitrix.</l><l xml:id="m-d52411fd-08a8-4716-9b2d-34d2820bae16" facs="#m-06db39fd-801a-4822-a02e-ee60dd566740" label="lyrics-like">K. Super chóros Angelórum ad caeléstia régna.</l><l xml:id="m-2fd5924c-aa5d-4760-b1a1-d6ed6743043a" facs="#m-944b1058-cd5a-4f2a-82b0-0cb452cc8ee1" label="text-like">At Bened.</l><l xml:id="m-827c535a-e698-41d9-87f4-70927ad86934" facs="#m-bde1185f-852a-4799-be83-b98b271eef19" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.8</l><l xml:id="m-d724d95a-793f-469d-9e62-a23b9fce2314" facs="#m-e7d7890d-7830-4b3d-8ad2-cac925b55711" label="ambiguous">2</l><l xml:id="m-ab04929f-755b-4a61-a4eb-c0b9a4d7c6c0" facs="#m-889b7ab8-75b9-4e93-8220-8c203cebed3a" label="lyrics-like">Uae est ista, “ quae ascéndit sic-ut auróra</l><l xml:id="m-9c1493e6-e2db-4031-bd30-1144c79f09ae" facs="#m-80b7d8d3-d4f7-4109-b073-24b07d3a909d" label="lyrics-like">e-lécta ut sol,</l><l xml:id="m-655feaac-30a1-44c7-b0c3-ef5ee2c79d87" facs="#m-ca1e53f1-801b-4cbb-9b70-20997b89a884" label="lyrics-like">consúrgens? púlchra ut lú-na,</l><l xml:id="m-004d935b-6c3e-458d-aee2-351d092536ac" facs="#m-0c512d18-ded5-486f-9edc-bb9a429f3856" label="lyrics-like">ter- rí-bi-lis ut castrórum á-ci- es ordi-ná-ta.</l><l xml:id="m-171fc05d-02df-4376-b154-7cb1bfd2f084" facs="#m-6691cba6-6b0c-4f31-a94d-e6b543f79cbc" label="lyrics-like">E u ou a e. Prayer. Omnípotens sempitérne Deus. p. 1602.</l><l xml:id="m-6e6e2157-1992-4e3d-bfaa-fac6ac2b1dbc" facs="#m-6d804417-8b19-42d4-bde5-80ea5a78419a" label="lyrics-like">At Prime. Ant. Assúmpta est. p. 1605. In the Short Resp. the V. 1s</l><l xml:id="m-534e0fa4-4c77-435b-919e-cbbb2247ecb8" facs="#m-1d541c2e-54a3-4ad3-89de-68d9c8e0ceda" label="lyrics-like">Qui nátus es de Marla Virgine. D. 229. This V. is sad throughout the</l><l xml:id="m-8c5d929a-0363-4cca-bda2-b8275976d595" facs="#m-4a02b44a-8489-47e3-bfd5-28dbce69a1be" label="lyrics-like">Õctave. Short Lesson. Tu glória Jerúsalem. D. 1605.</l><l xml:id="m-654524ef-c54d-4ce5-80da-f667fca22aae" facs="#m-800ac566-a5ea-4db1-a5c6-2c82eea66bf7" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-a4487198-3371-493a-b94d-44b4b04d94f6" facs="#m-98ff5b94-69dd-44d9-a301-3a58df3a48e4" label="ambiguous">Hymn, p. 1256.</l><l xml:id="m-100e3ea3-fd1f-471b-b6e3-809bc337a053" facs="#m-c2428ab1-8938-440d-862b-e90536ed832e" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Maria Vírgo. D. 1605. Chapter. Benedixit te Dóminus. D. 1606.</l><l xml:id="m-973a1ea7-cc78-48bf-a439-1cea955d7614" facs="#m-c19e58ba-f986-4c84-b291-0cb732292828" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-a2f7ea69-08bc-4be9-8bc6-4829690633d6" facs="#m-846aad90-3c76-44d1-b4c3-bc80c4d38d3c" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-e6fc7f23-6f8f-4f4d-a92f-b00a6a0e6cc6" facs="#m-e5e2fb02-7fbb-4e18-bcc4-529e7a87583d" label="lyrics-like">x-altá-ta est “Sáncta Dé- i Génitrix. V. Super</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
